&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that you have read and understood our Candidate Privacy Notice, which provides important information about the data we collect during the application process. You can find it &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.goodnotes.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
