&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Join &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Optiver&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; Compliance team in London and play a key role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; supporting our growing Institutional Sales &amp;amp; Trading &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;. You will work directly with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;stakeholders across the firm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;a broad range of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;regulatory, conduct and financial crime matters, while&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; contributing to the development &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;of the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; Global Compliance framework &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;as the business continues to evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;72d9cead-5d7c-511f-a089-41bc1b2ad175|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[335559740,&amp;quot;253&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Arial,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Body text Optiver&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;BodytextOptiver&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Zsysbasis Optiver&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;As a Senior Compliance Officer, you will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;join&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; the Trading Advisory team in London&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;focusing on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; Institutional Sales &amp;amp; Trading&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Working closely with the front office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;, you will advise on counterparty interactions, communications, trading &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;activity,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and the regulatory framework within which the business &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;operates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;build a strong &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;understanding of the business and its trading workflows, independently &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;own &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;your advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;work,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;and become a trusted point of contact for the front office, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;proactively &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;identifying&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and addressing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; emerging &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; You will also lead initiatives from start to finish and work closely with Compliance colleagues across &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Optiver&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; global offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; independent Compliance advice to Institutional Sales &amp;amp; Trading, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;applying your knowledge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; of trading workflows, counterparties, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and applicable regulatory requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Advise&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;on&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;sales and trading conduct, including counterparty interactions, communications, conflicts of interest, confidential &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and cross-border activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Take ownership of financial crime assessments &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;across&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; counterparty onboarding, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;jurisdictions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and trading activity, including AML and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;sanction &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;risks, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;identifying&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;appropriate controls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and escalations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Review external communications, marketing materials, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;presen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;tations,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and disclosures to ensure they are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;accurate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;balanced,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;compliant with applicable &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Lead Compliance input into new products, counterparties, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and strategic initiatives, partnering with the business and control functions to develop compliant solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Assess relevant surveillance escalations and potential conduct concerns, and coordinate responses to regulatory and exchange enquiries, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;audits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and information requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Monitor regulatory developments, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;maintain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; practical policies and guidance, deliver targeted &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;training,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and collaborate with global Compliance colleagues while supporting junior team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;72d9cead-5d7c-511f-a089-41bc1b2ad175|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[335559740,&amp;quot;253&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Arial,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Body text Optiver&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;BodytextOptiver&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Zsysbasis Optiver&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;You have significant relevant experience in Compliance, Legal, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; or another control function within a financial institution, ideally &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;within an&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;investment bank or other institutional markets business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;with exposure to a trading floor environment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; strong &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; of the regulatory, conduct and financial crime &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;risks &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;institutional markets , including sales conduct, , conflicts of interest, confidential information, cross-border requirements, AML, sanctions, counterparty due diligence and jurisdictional risk, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;alogside&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;experience advising front-office stakeholders directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You have a strong understanding of financial markets and are comfortable developing detailed knowledge of products, trading &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;strategies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and transaction workflows. Experience across equities, FX, fixed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;income,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; or commodities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Experience working across multiple &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;jurisdictions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;, particularly the UK, EU and/or US, and applying different regulatory requirements to cross-border activities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;advantageous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;establish&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;credibility with experienced institutional sales and trading professionals and build strong relationships across functions and geographies, while &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;maintaining&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; independent judgement and providing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;constructive &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; where necessary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You take ownership of complex matters with limited oversight, lead initiatives from start to finish and drive issues through to a clear conclusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You are curious, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;analytical,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;solutions oriented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;. You &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;seek&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; to understand how the business &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;actually operates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; rather than applying regulation in isolation, and you turn complex regulatory requirements into concise, actionable advice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You have experience guiding junior colleagues, delegating &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;effectively,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and providing constructive feedback that improves the quality of the team&#39;s work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to constantly improve the market by injecting liquidity, providing accurate pricing, increasing transparency and acting as a stabilizing force no matter the market conditions. With a focus on continuous improvement, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets for everyone who participates. As one of the largest market making institutions, we are a trusted partner of 70+ exchanges across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;72d9cead-5d7c-511f-a089-41bc1b2ad175|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[335559740,&amp;quot;253&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Arial,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Body text Optiver&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;BodytextOptiver&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Zsysbasis Optiver&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;ou’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;In addition, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; receive:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;27 paid vacation days plus all UK public holidays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Daily breakfast and lunch, along with support on commuting expenses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Private medical insurance, pension scheme, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;ClassPass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; fitness membership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
