&lt;h3&gt;Rejoins l’aventure Signeasy chez Decathlon Digital !&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein du domaine Instore, responsable des outils utilisés dans nos magasins, l’équipe Signeasy développe et maintient les solutions liées au balisage (papier, électronique).&lt;br&gt;La bonne lisibilité de notre offre dans nos rayons étant un aspect stratégique de l’entreprise, l’équipe doit constamment fournir des solutions adaptées aux besoins business tout en assurant une haute disponibilité de celles-ci.&lt;br&gt;Dans le but de renforcer l’équipe, nous recrutons un-e &lt;strong&gt;Software Development Engineer Senior&lt;/strong&gt; basé-e à Nantes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu&#39;ingénieur logiciel senior, tu apportes ton expertise technique, ta rigueur d&#39;ingénierie et ton pragmatisme au cœur de l&#39;équipe opérationnelle pour concevoir des solutions robustes et évolutives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conception, Développement &amp;amp; Qualité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et développer (hands-on) des fonctionnalités complexes et à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être garant-e de la qualité de code, de la maintenabilité et du respect des bonnes pratiques (Clean Code, TDD, BDD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traduire les besoins Produit en pré-analyses et spécifications techniques claires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réduire et gérer la dette technique de manière proactive par un refactoring continu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production, Performance &amp;amp; Observabilité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la haute disponibilité et la résilience de l&#39;application en production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et implémenter le monitoring et l&#39;observabilité du périmètre (logs, métriques, traces) pour anticiper et résoudre rapidement les incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimiser les performances de nos outils et de nos flux de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Partage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Animer et participer activement aux revues de code (Code Reviews) pour diffuser les standards de l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner et mentorer les développeurs plus juniors dans leur montée en compétences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer les nouveaux usages (notamment l&#39;assistance par IA) pour optimiser notre delivery et nos pratiques de test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Back-end :&lt;/strong&gt; Java 25, SpringBoot 4, Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front-end :&lt;/strong&gt; Vue.js, JavaScript/TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Données &amp;amp; Flux :&lt;/strong&gt; PostgreSQL, Valkey, Kafka, RabbitMQ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; DevOps :&lt;/strong&gt; GCP, Azure, Github Actions, Keda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualité logicielle :&lt;/strong&gt; Cucumber/Gherkin, Gatling, Playwright JS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observabilité :&lt;/strong&gt; OTEL, Datadog, Kibana, Grafana&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Méthodologie &amp;amp; outils :&lt;/strong&gt; Scrumban, GitHub, IntelliJ, VSCode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principes de développement :&lt;/strong&gt; TDD, BDD, Testcontainers, Archi Hexa, Event Driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as déjà une expérience significative (+5 ans) sur un rôle similaire de développeur/se senior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises les architectures modernes (Event Driven, Architecture Hexagonale) et les bonnes pratiques de développement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un bon niveau d’anglais (B2/C1).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es curieux-se, force de proposition et à l&#39;affût des innovations techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ton pragmatisme assure l’équilibre entre l&#39;excellence technique et la vitesse de livraison.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ton esprit d&#39;équipe et ton sens du collectif te permettent de partager facilement ton savoir-faire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 jours de télétravail par semaine (jours libres).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liberté de choix de l&#39;outil de travail (Mac, Windows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Équipe projet en local et partage avec le réseau mondial (parcours international).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Montée en compétences et mentorat (diversité de projets, langages et technologies, certification, events).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formations internes et externes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actionnariat salarié.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes mensuelles et trimestrielles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contexte &amp;amp; projet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La mission de Decathlon est de rassembler chacun autour des merveilles du sport pour rendre le bien-être accessible à tous. Pour y parvenir, l’excellence du design est indispensable à chaque étape de notre expérience numérique : aussi bien pour les millions de sportifs qui utilisent nos sites et applications, que pour les milliers de coéquipiers qui s’appuient chaque jour sur nos outils en magasin, en entrepôt et dans nos bureaux pour accomplir leur mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le design digital joue un rôle clé dans la croissance et la relation humaine chez Decathlon. Comment ? En garantissant des outils simples, fiables et agréables, et en apportant à notre communauté de designers les fondations, les systèmes et les pratiques partagées dont ils ont besoin pour concevoir les meilleures expériences possibles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ta mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce contexte, nous recherchons un(e) &lt;strong&gt;Digital Design Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;au sein du Product Center of Excellence (CoE) pour piloter nos capacités centrales de design, porter la vision stratégique, faire progresser l’excellence de notre métier et animer notre communauté de designers à travers tout Decathlon Digital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras une double mission :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager directement&lt;/strong&gt; l&#39;équipe dédiée au &lt;strong&gt;Design System&lt;/strong&gt; ainsi que l&#39;équipe &lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Research Ops&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Animer et inspirer fonctionnellement&lt;/strong&gt; la communauté des product designers digitaux intégrés dans nos différents domaines métier (eCommerce, applications magasin, Supply Chain, plateformes internes) et nos pays. Tu guideras également l&#39;évolution de nos pratiques de design à l&#39;ère de l&#39;IA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rôle &amp;amp; responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Digital Design Senior Manager, tu seras le partenaire stratégique chez Decathlon Digital pour :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager et faire grandir tes équipes en direct&lt;/strong&gt; (Design System et Design &amp;amp; Research Ops) : fixer leurs priorités, accompagner leur développement et veiller à ce que leur travail bénéficie concrètement aux équipes de Decathlon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter notre Design System&lt;/strong&gt; : garantir sa pertinence pour l’ensemble de nos expériences digitales : en accompagnant les spécificités des produits B2C, E2E, B2B et les expériences sportives. Mesurer son adoption et sa contribution à l’efficacité des équipes et à la qualité des expériences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter le Design &amp;amp; Research Ops&lt;/strong&gt; : Veiller à ce que les outils, méthodes et dispositifs mis en place répondent aux besoins réels des équipes, soient effectivement adoptés et contribuent concrètement à leur efficacité ainsi qu’à la qualité des décisions produits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accompagner et coacher nos coéquipiers designers de manière fonctionnelle&lt;/strong&gt; : clarifier les parcours professionnels, structurer les parcours d&#39;intégration (onboarding), faire monter en compétences et favoriser les synergies et le partage de pratiques entre les domaines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Porter la vision prospective du design et des ses pratiques, notamment à l&#39;ère de l’IA, &lt;/strong&gt;à travers une veille active et l&#39;expérimentation de nouvelles pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer les conditions d’une contribution active &lt;/strong&gt;de la communauté design à l&#39;évolution de nos outils, standards et pratiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construire des partenariats solides&lt;/strong&gt; avec les leaders Produit et Engineering afin de promouvoir l&#39;excellence du design, l&#39;accessibilité numérique (RGAA / WCAG), l&#39;écoconception et l&#39;impact business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Savoir-faire / Compétences clés&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environ 10 ans d&#39;expérience en design digital, acquis au sein d&#39;environnements produits complexes et internationaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience en management direct, idéalement avec des profils hybrides (designers, ingénieurs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fort leadership transversal, avec une capacité démontrée à influencer, conseiller et aligner les parties prenantes de niveau senior (Directeurs, équipes métier, tech et produit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance approfondie et forte sensibilité aux enjeux actuels du design digital, en particulier concernant l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle (IA) et l&#39;éco-conception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La maîtrise du français et de l&#39;anglais, à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral, est requise pour évoluer dans un environnement international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Savoir-être / Posture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence sans autorité hiérarchique&lt;/strong&gt; - Créer la confiance, inspirer les collectifs avec une vision claire et fédérer des designers, product managers et leaders tech répartis dans différents domaines autour de standards partagés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration transverse&lt;/strong&gt; - Travailler main dans la main avec des univers variés (Omni, Supply Chain, Sports, Plateformes), en comprenant leurs réalités opérationnelles spécifiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Générosité et partage métier&lt;/strong&gt; - Cultiver une culture d&#39;entraide où les équipes partagent leur travail tôt, apprennent de leurs erreurs et progressent ensemble.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sens du développement (Growth mindset)&lt;/strong&gt; - Rester curieux, humble et ancré dans le réel, en cherchant constamment à progresser et à faire progresser les autres tout en transformant les défis en opportunités d&#39;apprentissage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce poste est fait pour toi si…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu aimes faire grandir les autres et voir des équipes réussir grâce à ton soutien et ton accompagnement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu apprécies autant le management direct de proximité que l&#39;animation transversale d&#39;une communauté élargie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es passionné(e) par l&#39;avenir du design et enthousiaste à l&#39;idée de rendre l&#39;IA concrète, utile et centrée sur l&#39;humain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as le goût de simplifier la complexité et de construire des solutions pragmatiques et pérennes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu souhaites jouer un rôle moteur pour hisser l&#39;excellence du design au plus haut niveau chez Decathlon !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous t&#39;offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Télétravail flexible :&lt;/strong&gt; 2 jours de télétravail par semaine ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieux de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Bureaux Decathlon Digital à Lille ou Paris&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Équipement de qualité :&lt;/strong&gt; Matériel adapté à ta mission et conforme à nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou PC) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projet d&#39;entreprise stimulant :&lt;/strong&gt; Une équipe locale au sein d’un réseau mondial, ouvrant des opportunités de carrières internationales ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement des compétences :&lt;/strong&gt; Accompagnement continu (projets variés, certifications, formations internes et externes) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Package de rémunération :&lt;/strong&gt; Rémunération attractive (intéressement et participation aux bénéfices de l&#39;entreprise, primes mensuelles/trimestrielles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offre d&#39;Emploi : Data Steward (Center of Expertise Data &amp;amp; AI Governance - Central)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notre équipe &lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Governance&lt;/strong&gt; recherche un·e&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Data Steward (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt; en &lt;strong&gt;CDI&lt;/strong&gt; basé·e à &lt;strong&gt;Lille / Paris&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous croyons au pouvoir du sport pour unir et inspirer. Notre mission : rendre le sport accessible au plus grand nombre, partout dans le monde. Pour y parvenir, la data est au cœur de notre stratégie, guidant chaque décision, de la conception du produit à l&#39;expérience client. Notre défi ? La rendre gouvernée, sûre et exploitable. Tu rejoindras le Data &amp;amp; AI Governance Center of Expertise (CoE), une équipe dynamique de passionné·es, pour transformer notre patrimoine de données brutes en un actif certifié, auditable et actionnable, garantissant ainsi l’excellence de nos données et notre transition vers l&#39;IA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Data Steward&lt;/strong&gt;, tu seras un référent clé en Gouvernance des données pour les membres de la communauté fédérée. Tu joueras un rôle pivot dans la définition, le déploiement et l’amélioration continue des standards de gouvernance, avec un focus sur les sujets de Data Knowledge et/ou Data Quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ton temps sera partagé entre :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L&#39;accélération de la feuille de route centrale du CoE Data Governance&lt;/strong&gt; : définition des standards stratégiques (Data Governance by Design, référencement des exigences de qualité métier, pilotage centralisé de la qualité des données, intégration des exigences de gouvernance dans le projet Data Contract de la Data Platform, et développement du Data Knowledge / Context Layer, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L&#39;accompagnement d&#39;une Digital Unit / Domaine Métier&lt;/strong&gt; (Supply Chain, Commerce, Digital Sports ou Corporate Operations) et d&#39;équipes Pays : piloter la pratique de Data Stewardship, accompagner la montée en maturité, co-définir et piloter la trajectoire des OKR stratégiques (ex: 95% des données critiques respectant leur seuil de qualité) et animer la communauté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;TES RESPONSABILITÉS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu vas &lt;strong&gt;pousser&lt;/strong&gt; l&#39;organisation vers l&#39;excellence dans l&#39;exécution de la gouvernance et de la qualité des données par tous les moyens nécessaires, notamment :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Définir et faire évoluer le cadre de Data Governance&lt;/strong&gt; :
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unified Trust &amp;amp; DQ Metrics Store&lt;/strong&gt; : Participer à la structuration du Data Quality Metrics Store pour offrir une vision unifiée et transparente de la santé des données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gouvernance &amp;amp; Data Contracts&lt;/strong&gt; : Collaborer étroitement avec l&#39;équipe Data Platform pour veiller à ce que les exigences de gouvernance, de sécurité/conformité (classification, PII) et de qualité soient nativement intégrées dans le projet Data Contract (&lt;em&gt;&quot;Define once, apply everywhere&quot;&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Knowledge &amp;amp; Context Layer&lt;/strong&gt; : Structurer la connaissance technico-fonctionnelle dans le catalogue de données (Collibra) et promouvoir la couche de contexte (&lt;em&gt;Context Layer&lt;/em&gt;) pour faciliter la découvrabilité et le lignage des données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift-Left &amp;amp; Remédiation&lt;/strong&gt; : Déployer le modèle de responsabilité partagée avec les producteurs de données (&lt;em&gt;Quality by Design&lt;/em&gt;) et standardiser le suivi des plans de remédiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soutenir une Digital Unit / Domaine &lt;/strong&gt;:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner la pratique fonctionnelle et technique du Data Stewardship au sein d&#39;une verticale dédiée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des formations techniques et méthodologiques auprès des Data Stewards, Data Owners et producteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Évaluer la maturité Data Governance du domaine et accompagner les trajectoires vers la certification des actifs critiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apporter un support au quotidien et participer au recrutement des futurs coéquipiers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à définir les standards d&#39;excellence métier et évaluer le niveau d&#39;expertise lors des recrutements de la filière Data Governance au sein des domaines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu cultives des relations solides et basées sur la confiance avec un large éventail d&#39;interlocuteurs internes et externes, en gérant de manière experte les attentes et en favorisant l&#39;alignement sur les objectifs stratégiques. Tu fais preuve d&#39;une forte capacité d&#39;influence sans autorité directe, navigues efficacement dans les dynamiques organisationnelles et géres ta hiérarchie de manière proactive. Tu escalades les enjeux critiques de façon stratégique et en garantis la résolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur &amp;amp; Analyse&lt;/strong&gt; : Capacité à documenter, structurer des règles et résoudre des problèmes complexes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Métier &amp;amp; Gouvernance&lt;/strong&gt; : Les concepts de Data Governance, Data Quality Management, Data Lineage et Data Knowledge ne te sont pas inconnus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solide Compréhension Technique&lt;/strong&gt; :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais analyser, requêter et manipuler la donnée (langage SQL a minima).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu comprends les grands principes d’architectures Data modernes (Data Lake, Data Products, Data Contracts,...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une connaissance des outils de Data Quality et de Data cataloging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacité d&#39;articulation Tech &amp;amp; Business&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu sais traduire des besoins métier complexes en exigences techniques de gouvernance et vice-versa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ton quotidien, tu évolueras au sein d&#39;un écosystème technologique moderne incluant :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gouvernance &amp;amp; Métadonnées :&lt;/strong&gt; Collibra, Unity Catalog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architecture &amp;amp; Transformation :&lt;/strong&gt; Databricks, DBT, Airflow, Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diplôme&lt;/strong&gt; (Licence, Master ou École d&#39;Ingénieur) en Informatique, Data, Systèmes d&#39;Information ou domaine connexe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1-3 ans d&#39;expérience au minimum&lt;/strong&gt; en Data Governance, Data Stewardship, Data Quality ou gestion de programme data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience probante dans l&#39;animation de communautés et la conduite du changement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais courant (niveau B2/C1 minimum)&lt;/strong&gt; dans un environnement international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La Data Value Chain recrute !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REJOINS L&#39;ÉQUIPE DATA DOWNSTREAM INVENTORY MANAGEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l&#39;équipe Downstream Inventory Management, nous jouons un rôle crucial pour la supply chain de Decathlon. Notre objectif est d&#39;identifier le niveau de stock optimale de &lt;strong&gt;plusieurs dizaines de millions de couples article/magasin&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;chaque jour.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ces cibles de stock permettent le réapprovisionnement de plus de &lt;strong&gt;2000 magasins&lt;/strong&gt; dans le monde. Notre objectif est double : assurer la &lt;strong&gt;satisfaction client&lt;/strong&gt; en ayant le bon produit au bon endroit, tout en &lt;strong&gt;minimisant notre empreinte carbone&lt;/strong&gt; en évitant la surproduction, le surstockage et le transport inutile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analyst Inventory (STAGE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recrutons un.e Data Analyst&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;en &lt;strong&gt;stage&lt;/strong&gt;, basé.e à &lt;strong&gt;Lille.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TES MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu compareras &lt;/strong&gt;les méthodes de réapprovisionnement traditionnelles (formules analytiques min-max, ABC/XYZ) et les approches Data/ML (prévision quantilique, optimisation multi-échelon).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu développeras&lt;/strong&gt; des analyses de données pour aider la supply chain de Decathlon à prendre de meilleures décisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu mèneras&lt;/strong&gt; une étude complète de la qualité de l&#39;inventory management des magasins Decathlon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu contribueras&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; à l&#39;implémentation de la nouvelle solution proposée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu participeras&lt;/strong&gt; à la vie d&#39;une équipe agile composée de Data Analysts,Analytics Engineers (l&#39;équipe est jeune, sportive et basée entre Paris et Lille !).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TON ENVIRONNEMENT TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Langages : &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, Python (pandas, numpy, scikit-learn)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outils BI : Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Engineering : &lt;strong&gt;dbt&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;, Spark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plateformes Cloud : AWS, GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Versioning &amp;amp; DevOps : &lt;strong&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;, CI/CD, VSCode&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE DONT TU AS BESOIN POUR RÉUSSIR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es en dernière année d&#39;école d&#39;ingénieur, de commerce ou en Master 2 avec une&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;spécialisation en data ou supply chain.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu possèdes une forte &lt;strong&gt;capacité analytique&lt;/strong&gt; et une pensée créative pour &lt;strong&gt;résoudre des problèmes complexes&lt;/strong&gt;, ainsi que l&#39;aptitude à communiquer efficacement avec des parties prenantes non techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une &lt;strong&gt;première expérience significative&lt;/strong&gt; (projets universitaires, stage ou alternance) dans un environnement similaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une bonne compréhension des concepts liés à la &lt;strong&gt;chaîne d&#39;approvisionnement&lt;/strong&gt; et au &lt;strong&gt;commerce de détail&lt;/strong&gt; (gestion des stocks, facteurs influençant la demande).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es capable de travailler dans un &lt;strong&gt;environnement internationale&lt;/strong&gt;, la pratique de l&#39;anglais n&#39;a plus de secret pour toi !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une forte appétence pour le &lt;strong&gt;travail en équipe&lt;/strong&gt; et une culture du partage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu portes un intérêt pour l’&lt;strong&gt;impact du sport&lt;/strong&gt; sur le développement personnel et collectif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as l&#39;envie de rejoindre une entreprise engagée dans le &lt;strong&gt;Tech4Good&lt;/strong&gt; et l’innovation responsable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POURQUOI NOUS REJOINDRE ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous mettons un point d’honneur à offrir un cadre de travail épanouissant et motivant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; : entreprise certifiée &lt;strong&gt;Great Place to Work&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Happy Trainees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Des avantages attractifs&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(après 3 mois d’ancienneté)&lt;/em&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes mensuelles, intéressement, actionnariat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantages CSE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25% de réduction&lt;/strong&gt; sur nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prise en charge de ta CVEC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remboursement de 50%&lt;/strong&gt; du titre de transport &amp;amp; aide à la mobilité urbaine&lt;br&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Un accompagnement sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt; : coaching, formations internes et externes, partage de connaissances.&lt;br&gt;⚡ &lt;strong&gt;Une culture du sport et du test produit&lt;/strong&gt; : deviens ambassadeur.trice de nos innovations et rejoins nos équipes sportives internes !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FAQ – TOUTES TES QUESTIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comment préparer ma candidature et comment se déroule le processus de recrutement ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1️⃣ &lt;strong&gt;Lis bien l’offre&lt;/strong&gt; et mets en avant tes expériences et compétences les plus pertinentes.&lt;br&gt;2️⃣ &lt;strong&gt;Personnalise ton CV&lt;/strong&gt; pour te démarquer.&lt;br&gt;3️⃣ Après candidature, tu recevras une réponse sous &lt;strong&gt;deux semaines&lt;/strong&gt;. Si tu es sélectionné.e, tu passeras &lt;strong&gt;au moins deux entretiens&lt;/strong&gt; avec ton futur leader et un.e référent.e métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je ne connais pas le secteur du sport, ai-je ma place chez Decathlon ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien sûr ! Nous recherchons avant tout des personnes &lt;strong&gt;passionnées&lt;/strong&gt; et motivées, que ce soit dans leur domaine d’expertise ou par le sport en général.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être étudiant chez Decathlon, c’est quoi ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;C’est bien plus qu’une simple alternance ou un stage ! C’est &lt;strong&gt;façonner ton avenir professionnel&lt;/strong&gt; en contribuant à des projets concrets qui ont du sens pour toi, tout en étant &lt;strong&gt;accompagné et soutenu&lt;/strong&gt; à chaque étape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Notre ambition ?&lt;/strong&gt; T’offrir une expérience enrichissante pour te préparer à ton futur métier et, pourquoi pas, &lt;strong&gt;t’accueillir en CDI&lt;/strong&gt; à l’issue de ton stage. D’ailleurs, plus de&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;50% de nos étudiants&lt;/strong&gt; rejoignent définitivement l’aventure Decathlon ! 🚀&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer - Digital Unit Sports (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LE CONTEXTE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depuis plus de 50 ans, grâce à ses produits innovants et fort de sa culture reposant sur l’accessibilité, Decathlon ne cesse de réinventer le marché du sport.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre mission : rendre durablement les plaisirs et les bienfaits du sport accessibles au plus grand nombre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aujourd’hui, nous tirons parti de cette culture de l’innovation et de notre expertise digitale pour qu’un public plus large puisse bénéficier des plaisirs du sport et ce, à l’aide de la technologie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Nous créons de nouvelles expériences pour les sportives et sportifs – coaching virtuel, programmes de fidélité, expériences intelligentes en magasin, offres de produits neufs et d’occasion, mais aussi services de location d’une large gamme de produits Decathlon et de partenaires. Notre objectif : créer un écosystème digital de produits et services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Unit Sports&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;est au cœur de la transformation et de l’innovation de Décathlon car elle sert les équipes Décathlon en charge de la&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;construction de notre offre globale de produits, de la conception des produits et de leur commercialisation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;. Saviez-vous que 80% des produits vendus en magasins sont conçus et développés par Decathlon ? Une belle responsabilité !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu rejoindras la PIC (Product Info &amp;amp; Content) Data team qui est composée de Data Scientists, Data Analyst, BI engineers, ML/AI engineer et Data PM.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L’objectif de l’équipe est d&#39;obtenir une information produit et une qualité de contenu supérieures à grande échelle grâce à l&#39;IA et à l&#39;analytics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOS RESPONSABILITÉS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En tant que AI Engineer au sein de l&#39;équipe PIC , vous aurez l&#39;occasion de :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les PM et data scientists pour identifier les opportunités d&#39;impact business, exploiter les données pour quantifier les résultats et participer à la planification de la stratégie et de la feuille de route AI pour l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire et produire des systèmes agentiques de bout en bout innovants, avec une focalisation sur l&#39;évaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer des systèmes intelligents de surveillance et d&#39;observabilité en temps réel de la solution ML et des données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Déployer des LLMs (Large Language Models) et LMMs (Large Multimodal Models) en production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer des web apps impactantes pour nos partenaires business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer au partage des bonnes pratiques sur les outils MLOps et LLMOps afin d&#39;améliorer la productivité et la qualité des résultats pour les ingénieurs et les scientifiques de données ML dans toute l&#39;entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Résoudre des problèmes avec un accent sur le développement de produits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectuer des recherches et des expérimentations pour évaluer et implémenter de nouvelles techniques et technologies ML/AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la qualité et la performance des modèles en utilisant des techniques de validation rigoureuses et en surveillant les modèles en production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler avec les équipes DataOps pour automatiser le déploiement et la gestion des modèles ML.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger et maintenir la documentation technique pour les systèmes et les modèles développés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le Périmètre Technique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python&amp;nbsp;(FastApi, Langchain, Langraph, Pydantic)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spark/PySpark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks (Genie, Experiments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS S3/DBFS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Glue/DeltaLake&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS SageMaker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Bedrock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP Vertex AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP Cloud Run&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP Alloy DB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP Cloud SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP Agent Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Airflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MLflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamlit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE DONT VOUS AUREZ BESOIN POUR RÉUSSIR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez au moins 3 ans d&#39;expérience en Machine Learning / MLOps incluant la mise en production de solutions de ML ayant un impact à grande échelle sur les clients/users ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une première expérience GenAI / Agentic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maitrisez Python avec une solide compétence à produire un code de qualité de production performant ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes solides dans vos capacités à choisir la bonne méthode de MLOps et LLMOps pour résoudre un problème dans le cadre de contraintes actuelles tout en ayant une vision claire des prochaines itérations et un bon équilibre entre l&#39;exploration et l&#39;exploitation de différentes techniques ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une expérience avec Docker, Kubernetes, Hive, Airflow, MLflow ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez expérimenté.e le développement en TensorFlow, Pytorch…;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous démontrez des compétences solides dans l&#39;analyse de données à grande échelle via Spark ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez l’Anglais (contexte international) et pouvez parler en français (conversationnel)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous possédez une compréhension approfondie du processus du cycle de vie de l&#39;ingénierie du ML ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous possédez une compréhension approfondie du deep learning, du feature engineering, de la feature selection et des algorithmes d&#39;optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes particulièrement sensible à l’impact de la pratique du sport pour les valeurs qu&#39;elle vous a permis d’acquérir dans votre style relationnel et la vie en équipe !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez envie de rejoindre une entreprise à impact positif (#Tech4Good) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Senior Product Manager - Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lille or Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; Omnicommerce &amp;amp; Customer — Loyalty &amp;amp; Account Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;About Decathlon &amp;amp; The Omnicommerce Domain&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Decathlon is accelerating its digital transformation with the mission of becoming the sports digital platform that allows customers to discover our universe through local, sport-centered, and omnichannel experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;By joining this scope, you will work within the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;48&quot;&gt;Omnicommerce &amp;amp; Customer&lt;/strong&gt; Unit. Our mission is to leverage cutting-edge technology to build trusted, seamless, and deeply personalized relationships at scale. We design the platforms that connect our members to the entire Decathlon ecosystem—online, on mobile, and in our physical stores worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Join the Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount Squad&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Membership Group Product Manager, you will take end-to-end ownership of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;114&quot;&gt;Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount&lt;/strong&gt; Product Team across our 3 front platforms: Responsive Web, iOS, and Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;You will lead a multi-disciplinary team alongside a dedicated Engineering Manager, Software Engineers (Web, iOS, Android), Product Designers, Data Analysts, and Product Marketing Managers (PMM), while partnering closely with central sports teams and local Country Loyalty leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Empowering enduring customer relationships through a frictionless, rewarding, and deeply personalized omnichannel membership journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Transition our membership product from a historical &quot;Run&quot; maintenance state into a high-tempo value delivery engine. You will drive identified omnichannel transactions, member lifetime value, and profile enrichment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define Vision &amp;amp; Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and drive the end-to-end product vision, strategy, and outcome-based roadmap for Membership and MyAccount across Web, iOS, and Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Accelerate Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the operational shift from run-mode maintenance to a high-velocity feature delivery model, turning the membership space into a core business growth lever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&quot;Build vs. Buy&quot; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Bridge central business objectives with local country requirements, establishing a unified global membership experience while accommodating local market nuances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Experimentation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Continuous Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover high-impact member friction points through quantitative analytics, regular user interviews, usability testing, and benchmark studies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;UX/UI Simplification:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Design and Research to streamline complex account features, rewards catalogs, and loyalty point visibility into intuitive, engaging cross-platform interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experimentation Framework:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish continuous A/B testing and multivariate testing processes to validate hypotheses on member engagement, opt-in mechanics, and reward redemption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Alignment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Agile Product Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer sprint cycles and backlog prioritization in tight synergy with the Engineering Lead, Mobile Engineers, and Web Developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Backlog Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Write precise Epics, User Stories, and robust acceptance criteria; anticipate cross-squad dependencies and ensure smooth release management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Journey Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Core E-Commerce teams (Cart, Checkout, PDP) and In-Store Cashtill teams to seamlessly embed member identification, instant rewards, and profile perks across all purchasing journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Go-to-Market Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Synchronize feature releases with Product Marketing Managers (PMM) and local digital teams, orchestrating simultaneous rollouts across Web and App Stores (iOS / Android).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define &amp;amp; Monitor KPIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and steer North Star and operational metrics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Identification:&lt;/em&gt; Total Active Members, Profile Completion Rate (PCR), and Omnichannel Identified Transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Loyalty Economics:&lt;/em&gt; Points Issued vs. Redeemed, Burn Rate, Member Lifetime Value (LTV), and Reward Engagement Rate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Arbitrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Ground roadmap prioritization in rigorous analytics, sunsetting obsolete features and scaling initiatives with proven incremental business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;Product Mindset &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;24,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Excellence &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the global ambassador for membership and account experience standards across Decathlon&#39;s international tech and business communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;24,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster an autonomous, high-trust engineering culture grounded in psychological safety, shared accountability, and customer obsession.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of Product Management experience leading consumer-facing (B2C) digital products, customer portals, account spaces, or loyalty ecosystems at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Multi-Platform Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record in orchestrating feature delivery across both &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;90&quot;&gt;Responsive Web and Native Mobile Apps (iOS &amp;amp; Android)&lt;/strong&gt;, with solid understanding of mobile app release cycles and store guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Domain &amp;amp; E-Commerce Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of omnichannel e-commerce dynamics, conversion funnel optimization, customer retention mechanics, and loyalty economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Complete mastery of modern discovery and delivery frameworks (Dual-Track Agile, Scrum/Kanban, customer interview techniques, A/B testing, Build vs. Buy assessments).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional interpersonal skills with demonstrated success navigating complex, multi-stakeholder international matrix organizations (aligning global tech teams, central business units, and local country leaders).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly analytical and fluent in using analytics platforms to derive customer insights and back product decisions with hard data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English (written and spoken) with concise communication and synthesis skills; French is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; Excited by scalable customer-facing architecture, seamless digital-to-physical omnichannel journeys, and driven by a strong passion for sports !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Remote Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid model with 2 days of remote work per week (flexible).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based at our Decathlon Digital hubs in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;54&quot;&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;63&quot;&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt;, France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choice of Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Mac or Windows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; High-visibility leadership role at the core of Decathlon&#39;s customer strategy, offering structured mentorship, continuous upskilling, and international mobility paths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Financial Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive remuneration package including employee shareholding options (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;96&quot;&gt;actionnariat salarié&lt;/em&gt;), as well as monthly and quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Accessibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: which is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people from all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to offering an inclusive and accessible selection process to all candidates. Should you require any accommodations, you can request them via the application form, and your request will remain confidential. These requests do not affect the outcome of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all. Fulfilling this mission requires design excellence at both ends of our digital experience: for the millions of sports lovers using our customer apps and websites, and for the thousands of teammates who rely on our tools in stores, warehouses, and offices to do their jobs every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital design plays a pivotal role in supporting Decathlon’s growth and human connection. How? By ensuring our digital tools are simple, reliable, and enjoyable, and by giving our design community the shared foundations, systems, and practices they need to deliver the best possible experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Design Senior Manager &lt;/strong&gt;within the Product Center of Excellence (CoE) to lead our core design capabilities, provide thought leadership on the future of our craft, and support our design community across Decathlon Digital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Design Leader, you will have a dual mission: you will directly manage the Design System team and the Design &amp;amp; Research Ops team, while functionally leading and inspiring the community of digital product designers embedded across our different business domains (eCommerce, Store apps, Supply Chain, and internal platforms) and countries. You will also steer how design evolves at Decathlon in the era of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Digital Design Leader, you will act as a strategic partner at Decathlon Digital to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and develop your direct teams &lt;/strong&gt;(Design System and Design &amp;amp; Research Ops): set their priorities, support their professional growth, and ensure their work delivers tangible value to Decathlon teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead our Design System&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure its relevance across all digital touchpoints by catering to the specific needs of B2C, E2E, and B2B products, as well as sports experiences. Measure its adoption and its contribution to team efficiency and experience quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Design &amp;amp; Research Ops&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure that tools, methods, and operational frameworks meet real team needs, are effectively adopted, and tangibly contribute to operational efficiency and the quality of product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support and coach our design teammates functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; clarify career paths, structure onboarding programs, drive upskilling, and foster synergies and best-practice sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion a forward-looking vision for design and its practices&lt;/strong&gt;, especially in the era of AI, through active industry monitoring and experimentation with emerging practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create the conditions for active community contribution &lt;/strong&gt;to the evolution of our tools, standards, and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong partnerships with Product and Engineering leaders&lt;/strong&gt; to advocate for design excellence, digital accessibility (RGAA / WCAG), eco-design, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Around 8-10 years of experience in digital design&lt;/strong&gt;, gained within complex, international product environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record in direct management&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally leading hybrid profiles (designers, engineers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, with a demonstrated ability to influence, advise, and align senior stakeholders (Directors, business teams, tech, and product).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding and strong awareness of current digital design challenges&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly regarding Artificial Intelligence (AI) and eco-design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both written and spoken French and English is required&lt;/strong&gt; to thrive in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence without authority&lt;/strong&gt; — Build trust, inspire teams with a forward-looking vision, and rally decentralized designers, product managers, and engineering leaders around shared standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Work closely with diverse domains (Omni, Supply Chain, Sports, Core Platforms), listening to their specific operational realities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Foster an open, generous craft culture where teams share work early, learn from failures, and help each other grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — Stay curious and grounded, proactively developing yourself and others while turning challenges into positive learning moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The CoE might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love enabling other designers and seeing teams succeed thanks to your support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy both direct team management and leading a wider community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited about the future of design and passionate about demystifying AI into practical, human-centered practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like bringing clarity to complex environments and building simple, scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in elevating design excellence across Decathlon Digital!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work locations: Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille or Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality gear: Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global reach: A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill development: Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation package: Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Director or VP of Product Marketing to lead that effort globally. This is a senior, hands-on role for someone who can connect deep technical understanding with positioning, distribution and commercial results. The title will reflect the experience and scope of the person we hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A good product story matters, but a story alone isn&#39;t enough. The person in this role needs to turn our infrastructure into clear customer problems we solve, compelling reasons to choose Telnyx and practical ways to try it. A great sample application, integration or reference architecture can do more than another 30-slide deck. So can a precise message that reaches a developer at the moment they are deciding how to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across Product, Engineering, Developer Relations, Sales and Marketing to bring those pieces together. You&#39;ll help shape what we launch, how we explain it, how buyers discover it and how our field teams take it to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coherent product story. Own positioning, segmentation and competitive differentiation across AI inference, Voice AI, agent and edge infrastructure, communications, networking and wireless. Make the full platform understandable without flattening the technical details that make it valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solutions people can actually use. Drive the packaging of sample apps, reference architectures, integrations, templates and working demos that prove what the infrastructure makes possible. Build repeatable plays for use cases such as contact centers, agent assist and industry-specific workflows. These should accelerate adoption and enterprise sales, not become disconnected software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distribution that reaches technical buyers. Shape how we win discovery through product pages, developer content, SEO, answer engine optimization (AEO), technical communities and paid acquisition. You won&#39;t necessarily operate every campaign, but you must understand the mechanics deeply enough to direct them: search and answer-engine visibility, technical site structure, intent, targeting, conversion paths, attribution and economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A field-ready commercial engine. Give enterprise sellers, FDEs and solutions teams the pitches, discovery frameworks, architecture diagrams, competitive proof, demos and ROI narratives they need to generate and advance opportunities. Translate platform capabilities into buying reasons for developers, technical executives and enterprise decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launches that translate into adoption. Work with Product and Engineering early, not after something ships. Choose the audience, packaging and launch strategy, then measure activation, qualified demand, field utilization and downstream pipeline. Build an operating cadence that keeps pace with a rapidly changing roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-native PMM team. Use AI research tools, coding assistants, agents and automation as part of everyday work to accelerate market research, competitive analysis, messaging tests, content production, demo development and go-to-market execution. Know when to trust those tools, how to evaluate outputs and where human technical judgment still matters. Lead the team to operate the same way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;ll measure success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ultimate measure is pipeline. Not the number of launches, assets, impressions or campaigns. We expect this leader to partner closely with Demand Generation and Sales to create measurable, qualified pipeline, improve conversion and accelerate opportunities. Product marketing should be able to show how specific product narratives, solutions, integrations and programs contribute to commercial results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Early wins will look like a dramatically clearer platform story; a small number of flagship use cases with runnable demos and integrations; sellers using consistent, technically credible plays; stronger discovery and conversion from search, AEO and paid channels; and a repeatable link from product launches to adoption and pipeline. We care about what works and scales, not activity for its own sake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve led product marketing for a complex B2B technical platform, ideally in AI infrastructure, developer tools, APIs, cloud, networking or communications. You can be strategic without becoming removed from the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are technically fluent. You can understand architecture, work with APIs or SDKs, interrogate a latency or cost claim and talk comfortably with engineers. You don&#39;t have to be a production engineer, but you need to know when a demo is real and when it&#39;s just a pitch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand modern technical acquisition. You&#39;re credible directing AEO, SEO, paid programs and developer-focused content, and can connect channel-level metrics to funnel economics and qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re already effective with AI tools and agents in your own work. You experiment, build workflows and use the technology to move faster. Familiarity with the limitations and evaluation of AI-generated outputs is as important as enthusiasm for the tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write exceptionally well, have strong instincts for enterprise sales, and know how to turn a complex product advantage into a clear reason to buy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built or led strong teams, can prioritize across competing launches and products, and enjoy working directly with product leaders and technical builders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telecom experience is not required. Technical curiosity, taste, speed and a track record of generating commercial impact matter more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to shape the market narrative for a company that owns the underlying network, communications and compute infrastructure it sells. The platform is real, customers are deploying it in production, and the commercial opportunity is substantial. You&#39;ll have direct access to senior leadership and the ability to build a PMM function measured by its contribution to growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telnyx is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from different backgrounds and evaluate candidates based on the skills and experience relevant to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dans un souci de clarté et d’accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l’écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité, en considérant tous les candidats sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique ou de religion. Tous nos postes sont également ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP est le partenaire de confiance des plus grandes marques mondiales pour assurer leur croissance. Nous réunissons une intelligence média de pointe, une créativité de classe mondiale, une production de nouvelle génération, des solutions pour transformer le marketing à l’ère de l’IA et un conseil stratégique d’expert au sein d’une seule compagnie. Propulsés par des talents exceptionnels et WPP Open, notre plateforme de marketing agentique, nous déployons l’IA à grande échelle pour aider nos clients à naviguer dans un monde en pleines mutations et à optimiser leurs investissements marketing. Pour plus d’informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;www.wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP Media&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est le collectif média global de WPP. Dans un monde où les médias sont omniprésents, nous regroupons la meilleure plateforme, les meilleurs talents et les meilleurs partenaires pour développer les solutions les plus innovantes, offrant une croissance inégalée à nos clients. Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;www.wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez WPP Media, nous croyons en la puissance de notre culture et de nos collaborateurs. Pour réussir dans ce poste, il est fondamental d&#39;incarner les valeurs qui nous unissent :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être Extraordinaire&lt;/strong&gt; en favorisant un leadership collectif et une créativité transformationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer un environnement Ouvert&lt;/strong&gt; en trouvant l&#39;équilibre parfait entre l&#39;épanouissement de nos collaborateurs et la satisfaction client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diriger avec Optimisme&lt;/strong&gt; en stimulant activement la croissance et la curiosité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de Conexance / Choreograph&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choreograph constitue le cœur technologique et data de l&#39;écosystème WPP, reliant la réflexion stratégique marketing à son déploiement opérationnel à grande échelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conexance&lt;/strong&gt;, entité clé de Choreograph, est le leader reconnu du Marketing Data-Driven en France. Forts de 20 ans d&#39;expertise, nous proposons des solutions data uniques basées sur la mutualisation de données transactionnelles (base de données coopérative multi-secteurs) et sur l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle au service de nos clients en &lt;strong&gt;France&lt;/strong&gt; et au &lt;strong&gt;Royaume-Uni (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre mission : permettre à nos clients (e-commerce, retail, presse, associations/caritatif, etc.) d&#39;exploiter tout le potentiel de leurs données pour optimiser leurs campagnes de prospection, de fidélisation et d&#39;activation (lookalike, scoring, segmentation, CRM, profiling).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Missions &amp;amp; Rôle&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein du &lt;strong&gt;Service Études&lt;/strong&gt; de Conexance et rattaché directement au &lt;strong&gt;Senior Lead Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;, vous intégrez une équipe dynamique et collaborative de 7 collaborateurs (Lead Data Analyst, Data Analysts, prestataires et alternant).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans un contexte résolument &lt;em&gt;Customer Centric&lt;/em&gt;, vous intervenez en support direct du commerce (FR et UK) afin de produire, analyser et restituer des études statistiques à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités clés :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Production d&#39;analyses statistiques &amp;amp; modélisations :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Élaborer des scores de prospection et modèles de lookalike (cas simples à complexes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des segmentations, études de profiling et analyses de répondants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectuer des comptages et sélections sur critères pour les campagnes de nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Garantie de qualité &amp;amp; respect des délais :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer des livrables rigoureux, fiables et structurés, répondant précisément aux besoins opérationnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Accompagnement commercial &amp;amp; restitution :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner ponctuellement l&#39;équipe commerciale en rendez-vous clients (France et UK) pour expliquer la démarche, valoriser les analyses et formuler des recommandations stratégiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Amélioration continue &amp;amp; innovation :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer activement aux réflexions inter et intra-services visant à optimiser nos méthodes de production, automatiser nos flux et explorer de nouveaux outils (dont l&#39;IA générative et de nouvelles approches d&#39;analyse).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trajectoire et montée en compétences :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À court terme (1 à 3 mois) :&lt;/strong&gt; Assimiler notre environnement technique et le process de production (FR/UK), devenir autonome sur le traitement des cas courants et consolider une rigueur méthodologique sans faille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À moyen/long terme :&lt;/strong&gt; Monter en autonomie sur les problématiques statistiques les plus complexes, gérer un portefeuille de demandes de bout en bout, être force de proposition sur l&#39;innovation et animer des restitutions auprès de nos interlocuteurs internes et externes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Profil recherché&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes passionné par la statistique et la valorisation de la donnée marketing, avec un tempérament curieux, proactif et un excellent relationnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation &amp;amp; Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Titulaire d’un &lt;strong&gt;Master 2 / Bac+5&lt;/strong&gt; en Statistiques, Machine Learning, Big Data, Data Science ou Intelligence Artificielle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; Environ &lt;strong&gt;2 ans d&#39;expérience&lt;/strong&gt; (alternance/stages significatifs inclus) dans un rôle axé sur le &lt;strong&gt;datamining&lt;/strong&gt;, la modélisation statistique ou l&#39;analyse de données orientée marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Techniques (Hard Skills) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indispensables :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise opérationnelle de &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise de la suite &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt; (Excel avancé, PowerPoint).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des techniques de &lt;strong&gt;Data Visualisation&lt;/strong&gt; (capacité à mettre en scène la donnée pour la rendre intelligible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atouts supplémentaires :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance de &lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt; et d&#39;outils de dataviz comme &lt;strong&gt;Power BI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensibilité à l&#39;&lt;strong&gt;IA générative&lt;/strong&gt; appliquée à la data, au &lt;strong&gt;storytelling&lt;/strong&gt; de la donnée et aux &lt;strong&gt;méthodes agiles&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Comportementales &amp;amp; Soft Skills :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur, esprit logique et méthode&lt;/strong&gt; dans la manipulation de volumes importants de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellente communication orale et écrite :&lt;/strong&gt; aisance relationnelle, élocution claire et capacité à vulgariser des concepts techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personnalité dynamique, souriante, à l&#39;écoute et bienveillante&lt;/strong&gt;, dotée d&#39;un fort esprit d&#39;équipe et d&#39;une bonne présentation en clientèle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivité :&lt;/strong&gt; curiosité intellectuelle, autonomie progressive et orientation solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais professionnel opérationnel (niveau B2 minimum requis)&lt;/strong&gt;, indispensable pour collaborer sur les comptes et campagnes du marché UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement de travail :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous évoluerez dans une équipe à taille humaine (environ 35 collaborateurs dans l&#39;entreprise, 6 dans l&#39;équipe Études) où la bienveillance, la collaboration, l&#39;écoute, la qualité, la rigueur, la méthode et l&#39;innovation sont des valeurs fondamentales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un poste basé à Lille, avec une politique de travail hybride : 100% en présentiel durant la période d&#39;essai, puis possibilité de 2 jours de télétravail par semaine en moyenne (avec 12 jours de présence obligatoire par mois sur site après validation de la période d&#39;essai).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; et ses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; avantages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre engagement à façonner l&#39;avenir des médias se manifeste par un soutien actif au développement professionnel de nos talents, les aidant à atteindre leur plein potentiel. Cette démarche s&#39;accompagne d&#39;une vision responsable dans nos stratégies d&#39;investissement médiatique, reflétant ainsi notre double priorité : valoriser nos collaborateurs tout en adoptant des pratiques durables dans notre secteur. Les collaborateurs de WPP Media ont un accès privilégié aux réseaux internationaux de WPP Media et WPP, leur permettant de développer leurs passions, d&#39;étendre leur réseau professionnel et de rester à la pointe des innovations en marketing et publicité. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous disposons de ressources vastes et variées au service de nos collaborateurs, notre entreprise cultive activement l&#39;inclusion des talents de tous horizons. Les réussites et expertises des équipes sont régulièrement mises en lumière lors d&#39;événements fédérateurs qui ponctuent également les moments clés de l&#39;année, renforçant ainsi notre culture d&#39;entreprise collaborative et diversifiée. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération et avantages&lt;/strong&gt; : Salaire compétitif, mutuelle (prise en charge employeur à 70%), prévoyance, titres-restaurant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congés et équilibre vie pro/perso&lt;/strong&gt; : 25 jours de congés payés annuels, 12 jours de RTT (pour une année civile complète), jours de congé additionnels par palier de 5 ans d’ancienneté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilité et télétravail&lt;/strong&gt; : Durant la période d’essai, 100% en présentiel. Puis possibilité de télétravail 2 jours par semaine en moyenne (avec 12 jours de présence par mois obligatoires sur site après validation de la période d&#39;essai).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobilité durable&lt;/strong&gt; : Forfait Mobilité Durable (facultatif au choix du salarié).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous nous engageons à rendre ce process aussi rapide et efficace que possible, et à maintenir une communication ouverte et transparente tout au long du process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Échange RH : &lt;/strong&gt;Premier entretien de découverte (téléphonique ou visio) avec l&#39;équipe Talent Acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien physique &amp;amp; Business Case : &lt;/strong&gt;Rencontre dans nos locaux avec le Senior Lead Data Analyst incluant un cas pratique / test technique (pour vous projeter concrètement dans notre quotidien) et un échange avec la HRBP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien de finalisation (si nécessaire) &lt;/strong&gt;: Échange complémentaire avec le N+2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media garantit l&#39;égalité des chances et considère tous les candidats sans discrimination ni considération de caractéristiques particulières. Nous nous engageons à cultiver un environnement de respect où chacun se sent à sa place et bénéficie des mêmes opportunités d&#39;évolution professionnelle. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consultez notre politique de confidentialité pour tout savoir sur la protection de vos données &lt;a href=&quot;https://open-web-sk.wpp.ai/chat/7aQi197iYDxX62kecaQzY/LIEN_VERS_POLITIQUE_DE_CONFIDENTIALITE&quot;&gt;politique de confidentialité&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien que nous étudiions toutes les candidatures reçues, nous ne contactons que les personnes sélectionnées pour un entretien.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam, following its acquisition of&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI - the leader in AI-powered data security posture management (DSPM) - is&amp;nbsp;seeking a Senior Sales Engineer to drive technical leadership in our sales team, focusing on the&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI portfolio. You will partner with a&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;Sales Specialist and support 3–5 Account Executives and Veeam Solution Engineers as the technical subject matter expert.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will guide customers from needs assessment to solution design,&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;hands-on demos and proof-of-concepts to&amp;nbsp;showcase&amp;nbsp;value. Success in this role requires strong technical skills and the ability to build trust with clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical contact for&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI solutions during the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discussions and deliver customized security solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address customer needs in data discovery, posture management, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and present product demonstrations and proof-of-concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, engineering, and customer success teams to ensure smooth transitions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience&amp;nbsp;in pre-sales or sales engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data and/or cloud security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator with both technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years technical sales experience in security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in Software/SaaS/Enterprise technical sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data privacy/security standards (e.g., GDPR, NIST 800-53, ISO 27001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DSPM frameworks, Linux, Kubernetes, or cloud data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications (CISSP, CISM, or cloud-specific)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam offers benefits that support your whole self:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;962d2596-0d84-4634-8122-e72620efaf3a&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days plus RTT days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;ac5169f0-07e3-489b-8abe-892be770a0b0&quot;&gt;Mandatory public health insurance with broad medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6d7de02c-c10d-4630-8e3a-d6fc9459e7d9&quot;&gt;Employer-paid private medical, dental, optical, and wellness plan through Axa, with options for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;61b12e02-8f54-4d15-96d6-bbc42318ce88&quot;&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage above the Social Security ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b2ca2bc7-2cd7-4995-9fc1-a5c272ebb57b&quot;&gt;Education pension for dependent children up to age 26 if in full-time education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;857127a3-8f58-4d62-9dd4-f69b9f89cff8&quot;&gt;State and supplementary pension contributions by Veeam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;73fa609e-fa75-463b-994c-f8b6c840141c&quot;&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: If an applicant is permanently located outside of France, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;app&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Cryogenic Engineer to support and develop advanced cryogenic platforms for our SNSPD (Superconducting Nanowire Single-Photon Detector) product line, with a strong emphasis on next-generation rack-mountable systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a cross-functional team dedicated to advancing world-class quantum technologies that address some of the most complex challenges in computing, networking, and sensing. In this role, you will play a central part in the development lifecycle, overseeing cryogenic subsystems and ensuring robust, reliable 2K cryo-systems that can be deployed across internal and customer environments, while remaining maintainable and adaptable as the technology evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of engineering and innovation, you will lead system-level specification, integration, and testing of cryogenic platforms tailored to SNSPD requirements. You will collaborate closely with internal teams, subcontractors, and external partners to design, configure, and improve deployable systems, while also providing operational support for existing platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position suits a highly experienced engineer with a strong background in cryogenic systems, hands-on expertise with cryostats and related technologies, and the ability to drive integration efforts across multidisciplinary teams and external vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree (PhD preferred) in applied physics, system engineering, mechanical engineering, or a related field, with 5-7+ years of experience in the cryogenic industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing, evaluating, and maintaining complex cryogenic systems, including dilution, sorption, and 1 K cryostats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of cryogenic wiring, sensors, electronics, and CAD-based design and manufacturing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with cryogenic vendors, subcontractors, and external design partners on system integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desirable expertise in fibre or free-space optics, superconducting nanowire single-photon detectors, and leading integration projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Backend Engineer in the Vinted Go Carrier domain, you will build backend systems that move parcels through Vinted Go&#39;s own logistics network, between hubs and through warehouses, quickly, reliably and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join Vinted Go, the logistics arm of Vinted, focused on making shipping more affordable, convenient, and reliable. Your team, &lt;strong&gt;Pacman&lt;/strong&gt;, owns mid-mile logistics and warehouse operations automation: how parcels are routed and transported between hubs, and how they are received, labelled, and dispatched.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a strong engineer who also makes the engineers around them better: someone who leads the team&#39;s hardest technical problems and actively shares what they know, so the whole team grows with them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable backend services and APIs that power mid-mile transport and warehouse operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical initiatives end to end, from problem framing and system design through delivery, monitoring, and iteration, and lead projects that span the team or the wider domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architecture and trade-off decisions with a 6–12 month horizon, balancing scalability, reliability, maintainability, and tech debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve our core service, a large Ruby on Rails modular monolith, towards clearer module boundaries and well-defined APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Operations, Decision Science, and neighboring engineering teams to shape discovery, sequencing, and implementation, and align on contracts and dependencies through RFCs and technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively share knowledge: give thoughtful code reviews, pair on hard problems, walk the team through complex changes, and keep documentation useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help onboard new team members, mentor engineers informally, and trust others with meaningful work while supporting them to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a backend stack that includes Ruby, Vitess, Kafka, Jenkins, Elastic, and observability tools; you do not need to know all of it upfront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of service reliability, alerts, metrics, SLOs, and incident follow-up, including participation in on-call rotations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in hiring by interviewing candidates and helping raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools thoughtfully to improve your development workflow and help the team move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of backend engineering experience, with a track record of building systems and owning work from design through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Ruby, or the ability and motivation to learn Vinted&#39;s backend stack quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of API design, database-backed systems, observability, and operating services in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works independently on problems of diverse scope, and is someone teammates turn to for advice on difficult technical matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic problem solver who balances delivery speed, reliability, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with ambiguity and breaking complex product or operational problems into clear technical steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely enjoys sharing knowledge and mentoring others, and sees raising the team&#39;s engineering standards as part of the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gives direct, useful feedback, seeks it in return, and builds alignment across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and clear communicator who works well with engineers, product managers, operations, and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: experience with logistics, warehouse management, fulfillment, or operational workflows; integrating software with physical devices; or modularizing a large monolith.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to all the tools &amp;amp; tech needed for work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Private health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pension plan with flexible contribution options and a matching contribution from Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In Vilnius office: Gym &amp;amp; in-house meals at friendly prices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In Kaunas office: a monthly lunch allowance, and a once-a-week provided in-house lunch and breakfast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€104.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Director of Engineering to lead the Frontend Technologies domain within Marketplace. In this role, your mission will be two-fold:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pivot our frontend setup for bigger efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;: we have been operating in mostly the same frontend setup for at least 6 years, and recognize that change is imminent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategic engineering initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;: architect and implement platform-specific changes that enhance modularity, autonomy, resilience, and performance across Android, iOS, and Web.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have to balance and prioritize foundational capabilities - such as Design Systems, CI/CD, Modularization, App Releases, Performance, and Global UI quality - to optimize both frontend developer velocity and user satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead 4 Engineering Managers and 3 Staff Engineers and set and implement the FE strategy, which will impact the roadmaps of 9 Product domains within the Marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategically:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure the most effective frontend setup for the Marketplace.&lt;/strong&gt; We have 40+ teams, each with 3 frontend engineers (iOS, Android, and Web) in the Marketplace unit. We know this will look different in two years. Deciding what different means, and getting 9 product domains to fund it, is the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technology Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Set and drive the future technology strategy for frontends, establishing a modular, scalable architecture that enables rapid development and strategic growth. Basically - raise the technological bar for all Marketplace unit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine the domain&#39;s identity: &lt;/strong&gt;Take sole ownership of shaping its future, successfully integrating Design Systems and engineering to treat our frontend platforms as a cohesive product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tactically&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead frontends:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead a horizontal, platform-focused domain containing Android, iOS, Web, and Design System teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee Marketplace-wide technical tooling, core libraries, and frameworks. Lead strategic projects, i.e., frontend modularization and modernization (SwiftUI/Jetpack Compose), native automated testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate global UI quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate design systems and accessibility into the frontend ecosystem to consolidate technical, visual and interaction quality standards. Support UI experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Resilience &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain robust release processes, Marketplace frontend quality, and performance monitoring to reduce downtime and ensure a consistent member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate &amp;amp; Optimize:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive AI-efficiency enablement in frontend development and explore cross-platform frontend development opportunities to increase engineering speed and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A lot of this work will be influencing without formal authority&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the frontend technical vision among your director peers, influencing the leaders of 9 Product domains to accommodate and prioritize platform-wide changes across 40+ teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How much of a technical acumen? &lt;/strong&gt;Enough to have in depth conversations with our direct reports. You will have 4 strong technical EMs reporting to you, as well as 3 world-class staff engineers. We don’t think you need to match their technical competencies (that’s a stretch!), but you have to be able to speak their language, understand problems at their essence, and be able to consolidate and multiply their inputs, including being able to disagree objectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;you have a track record of making level change in the organizations that you lead (rather than 20% change). Consolidating your team views and making coherent strategy out of those views is step one. Step two is even more important: being able to implement these changes in your domain, and more so - across other domains in the marketplace - is a foundational ability you carry. In practice, that means you have at least 2 years of experience leading leaders and 5 years of experience influencing without authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change horizon:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable holding two timeframes at once. We need someone who can say, &quot;Here is what our frontend setup should look like in two years, and here is why&quot; AND name the clear deliverable that has to ship in the first quarter to make that end state reachable. Leaders who only do the second are common. Leaders who only do the first are entertaining. We need both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this role is not:&lt;/strong&gt; This is not a hands-on frontend or release-engineering role. You will not be tuning CI, owning the release train, or reviewing architecture decisions yourself — you’ll have 4 strong EMs and 3 Staff Engineers close to the details, and your job is to turn their technical judgment into direction, alignment, and organizational change. If your strongest work is deep in the mechanics, you&#39;ll be underused here. If your strongest work is changing how 40+ teams operate, you&#39;ll be busy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass (Gym Membership subsidy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with total contribution of 12%, 8% by the Company and 4% by employee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€147.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we build mission-critical IT solutions that power some of the most essential operations of our clients. Reliability, craftsmanship, and continuous improvement are at the heart of everything we do. We are looking for a Senior Freelance TypeScript Software Engineer who enjoys designing and building resilient, high-performance systems that have a direct impact on large-scale operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will help shape the future of critical digital infrastructures, working on complex challenges where software quality, scalability, and reliability truly matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Freelance Software Engineer with an open mind and a genuine passion for software architecture. Together with our customers, we solve a wide range of challenges, from creating more user-friendly online banking platforms and designing business-critical portals and backend systems, to making industrial environments smarter through the combination of cloud technologies and IoT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this specific project, you will work closely with developers and architects to design and build software that connects operator- and customer-facing hardware with a large-scale backend platform supporting parcel logistics operations across an international network of hubs. The platform powers critical parcel handling processes throughout Europe and beyond, serving as a key component in the global logistics chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The platform enables parcel intake, sorting, routing, and grouping processes across distribution hubs. It actively interacts with parcels in real time, processing events generated by scanners, handheld devices, and automated sorting systems. Every parcel moving through the network is represented and tracked by the platform, making it one of the most visible and operationally critical systems within the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this assignment, we are specifically looking for freelance professionals. We offer an initial 6-month contract with the possibility of extension, providing the opportunity to contribute to the continued evolution of a mission-critical platform operating at international scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal colleague brings:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years of professional software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and building microservices and event-driven architectures in cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing backend solutions with TypeScript and Node.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building serverless applications on AWS, particularly with services such as AWS Lambda and DynamoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write high-quality, maintainable, reusable, and well-tested code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large-scale distributed systems processing high volumes of real-time operational events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines, such as GitHub Actions, and modern cloud-native development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating services and APIs within complex enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills and the ability to work closely with engineers and architects to design reliable and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A security-first mindset; practical security experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everyone we work with, and everyone we consider working with, has the right to equal treatment. Our hiring process is designed to be thorough, objective, and fair, ensuring equal opportunities, compensation, and growth for all candidates and colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great teams are built through diversity of thought, background, experience, and perspective. We actively encourage applications from people of different nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and backgrounds, and are committed to fostering an inclusive environment in which everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, our Platform Horizontal has evolved from solely managing the cloud into a broad function supporting Reliability, Developer Experience, Security, and Quality. We take a holistic approach to creating systems and tools that help developers deliver applications seamlessly and reliably without getting bogged down in infrastructure complexity.&lt;br&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Platform Engineer&lt;/em&gt;, you’ll work at the intersection of development, infrastructure, and operations. You’ll help shape and execute our long-term platform vision, empowering Catawiki teams to deliver value to customers with speed, reliability, and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build and improve the platform capabilities that enable our engineering teams to develop, deploy, and operate applications effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a self-service developer platform&lt;/strong&gt; with a particular emphasis on developer experience, designing and maintaining platforms that abstract complexity and give teams the tools to deploy, monitor, and optimise their applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate cloud-native infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, manage Kubernetes clusters and other cloud resources, focusing on performance, scalability, and cost efficiency through FinOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boost developer productivity&lt;/strong&gt; by building and enhancing CI/CD pipelines, GitOps workflows, and reusable templates that accelerate development and deployment cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive reliability and scalability&lt;/strong&gt; through applying practices for fault tolerance, disaster recovery, and scaling so applications run smoothly under changing conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve platform operations&lt;/strong&gt; usage and enhance our observability stack to monitor platform health and resolve incidents proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate and innovate&lt;/strong&gt; by partnering with product teams to understand their needs, build simple and impactful solutions, and champion cloud-native best practices across Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You measure what matters, introduce changes gradually, and treat failure as a normal part of learning. You use tooling and automation wherever possible to reduce toil, and enjoy sharing knowledge with others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cloud-native expertise&lt;/span&gt;: At least 5 years of production experience with Kubernetes, container orchestration, and cloud platforms such as GCP, AWS, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Automation mindset&lt;/span&gt;: Experience automating workflows and CI/CD pipelines and working with infrastructure-as-code tools such as Terraform or Ansible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Observability experience&lt;/span&gt;: Hands-on experience using and maintaining tools such as Prometheus, Grafana, ELK, or OpenTelemetry to improve reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong ownership&lt;/span&gt;: You proactively address platform issues and work toward long-term scalability and resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative approach: You work effectively with developers and cross-functional teams to align goals and deliver impactful yet simple solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous learning&lt;/span&gt;: You keep developing your knowledge of cloud-native tools, technologies, and practices in a fast-moving ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Horizontal supports engineering teams across Catawiki by reducing infrastructure complexity and providing reliable, secure, and scalable foundations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We collaborate closely with product teams to understand their challenges and improve their development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We favour self-service capabilities, reusable solutions, automation, and measurable, gradual improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We share knowledge and treat reliability, security, quality, and developer experience as shared responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;You will work from our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is open to candidates worldwide. For selected candidates, Catawiki &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;can provide visa sponsorship and relocation support to the relevant location&lt;/span&gt;, subject to eligibility and applicable restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;800+ Catawikians.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/span&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work From Home&lt;/span&gt; Allowance to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commuting&lt;/span&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Office&lt;/span&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role in Our Story:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ACT is strengthening its data, technology and AI capabilities as we build a more integrated digital platform alongside our core environmental commodities trading and market-making business. This transformation is commercially driven, enabling us to scale, deepen client relationships and support increasingly complex and digital markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Information Security Officer, you will own ACT’s enterprise information security strategy and governance at Group level, spanning our core operations, emerging digital businesses and client-facing technology platforms. You will define the security risk appetite, lead our response to an evolving threat landscape, and ensure security and resilience are embedded by design as our technology landscape develops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working across business and technology leadership, you will translate commercial ambition into a pragmatic and scalable security posture that protects our systems and data while maintaining the trust of clients, counterparties and regulators. In essence, your role involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Group-wide information security strategy and roadmap across ACT’s core market-making business and digital and client-facing platforms, aligned with business goals and industry frameworks such as ISO 27001 and NIST CSF. Define and maintain ACT’s cyber risk appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and lead security governance, including policies, standards and control frameworks, with clear accountability across the Group. Report on security posture and material incidents to executive leadership and, where relevant, the Board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Platforms &amp;amp; Secure-by-Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security-by-design into new products and client platforms, partnering with Data, Architecture and Commercial teams to ensure emerging digital capabilities are secure from inception, while acting as a credible security voice to clients and counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee application, product and SaaS security, embedding security throughout the software development lifecycle for internal and client-facing platforms, and assessing third-party services handling ACT and counterparty data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Resilience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead enterprise security risk management, including risk assessments, vulnerability management and third-party/supply-chain risk, driving timely mitigation across core and digital environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct incident preparedness and response, coordinating detection, containment, eradication and recovery, while continuously strengthening incident and crisis-management plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Emerging Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure ACT’s cloud and infrastructure through Zero-Trust-aligned controls, including identity and access management, segmentation and encryption, across a hybrid and multi-platform environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern emerging technology and AI security, extending security oversight to AI and data platforms, including model and data-exposure risks and AI-enabled threats, as ACT expands its use of AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure regulatory and compliance alignment, including GDPR, DORA and relevant sector obligations, advising the business on required adaptations and coordinating audits and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the security function and strengthen security culture across the Group, developing the team, raising security awareness, and acting as ACT’s primary authority and trusted advisor on cyber security to executives and business leaders, working alongside existing teams and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;665&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful in this role, we are looking for candidates with the following qualifications and attributes:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Information Security, Computer Science or a related field. A relevant Master’s degree is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–15 years of progressive experience in information security and cybersecurity, including at least 5 years in a senior security role, with ownership of enterprise security strategy, governance and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad security leadership experience across incident response, cloud and infrastructure security, product/application security and regulatory compliance. Experience securing client-facing platforms or digital products is highly valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within trading, financial services, commodities or another data-intensive and regulated environment is highly advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of security frameworks and standards, including ISO/IEC 27001, NIST Cybersecurity Framework and CIS Controls, with practical experience implementing them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of data protection, regulatory and compliance requirements, including GDPR, DORA and standards such as SOC 2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications such as CISSP, CISM or CISA, or equivalent, are highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to translate complex security risks into clear business implications and advise technical teams, executives, business stakeholders and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these criteria and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic and challenging environment, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be the strategic engine room of Raisin’s People &amp;amp; Culture team—building the secure, data-driven, and innovative infrastructure that empowers our people and scales the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We bridge the gap between people strategy and the technology that powers it. We ensure Raisin is future-ready, fair, and fully compliant by focusing on four core pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; We manage and evolve our HRIS landscape so P&amp;amp;C can focus on people, not manual processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; We leverage people analytics and AI automation to guide smarter business decisions, driving equity through modern Total Rewards frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; We act as P&amp;amp;C’s compliance anchor—taking ownership of audit requests, people policy and process transformation, and risk management (TPRM) to keep our infrastructure secure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for a People Analytics Manager to own the data, reporting, and insights of Raisin’s People function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will ensure smooth operations of our HR reporting systems and be the main point of contact for data-driven insights and analytics requests within our People tooling stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will build and maintain Raisin’s People dashboards and reports to meet the business needs based on the requirements of the People business functions and in close alignment with the People Solutions leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will look after the data modeling, trend analysis, and predictive analytics related to our workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will support seamless integrations of People data pipelines in close alignment with People and Culture leadership and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own the documentation of HR metrics, data definitions, and reporting structures across Raisin’s People applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a university degree in Data Science, Statistics, Economics, or a related field, or bring equivalent experience with a strong analytical background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of hands-on experience in People Analytics, Business Intelligence, or data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to translate complex data sets into clear narratives and actionable insights for business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong People domain knowledge incl. People processes across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly responsible, trustworthy, and adept at handling sensitive and confidential data with the utmost discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong communication skills and you feel comfortable collaborating with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with our tooling stack (especially with data visualization tools like Looker Studio and HRIS like Personio) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Enablement builds Raisin&#39;s internal AI platform. We make it easy and safe for every team, from engineering and product to business operations, to use AI in their daily work and in the products they build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We provide the shared foundation for that: governed access to AI models and tools, the controls that keep data secure and usage auditable, and the visibility teams need to run AI reliably and cost-effectively. We also shape how Raisin builds software with AI, from AI-assisted coding to agentic workflows that support teams across the development lifecycle. Because Raisin operates in regulated financial services, security and compliance are core to how we design the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is growing, and you will shape both what it builds and how it works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Lead, you lead the engineers who build Raisin&#39;s internal AI platform and drive the company&#39;s AI-assisted engineering practices. You are accountable for the team&#39;s delivery, growth, and maintaining the AI platform users&#39; trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You stay close to the technology, because in a field that changes this quickly, good leadership decisions depend on understanding the technical details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, and develop engineers, and build a team that works autonomously across platform engineering, infrastructure, and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold regular 1:1s, set clear expectations, and agree individual development plans with each engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give timely feedback, recognise strong performance, and address low performance early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment of trust, open communication, and continuous learning, so the team keeps up with a fast-moving field without burning out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery and operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end delivery, from planning and estimation through implementation and release, balancing new capabilities with reliability and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the platform runs well in production: on-call, incident handling, and service levels for the systems other teams rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot risks and blockers early and resolve them, or escalate in time with a clear proposal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the AI strategy into quarterly goals and a roadmap the team commits to, together with your manager and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the platform as a product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering, product, and business stakeholders to understand their needs and decide what the platform should offer next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure adoption, reliability, cost, and impact, and use that data in planning and when reporting to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the cost of AI usage and tooling, including budgets, licences, vendor relationships, and build-versus-buy decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the technical direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the team&#39;s tech leads on architecture and key technical decisions, and stay hands-on in design discussions, reviews, and selected implementation work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with security, legal, and compliance colleagues to keep the platform and the company&#39;s use of AI secure and compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help engineering teams across Raisin adopt AI in their work through documentation, workshops, and direct support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years leading engineers as an Engineering Manager, Engineering Lead, or Team Lead, including hiring and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in software engineering overall, with a background in backend, platform, infrastructure, or developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a team that builds for internal customers, such as a platform, developer tooling, or shared services used by other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering production systems that other teams depend on, including ownership of their reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of modern AI integration, such as LLM APIs, AI coding assistants, and agentic workflows, deep enough to evaluate technical decisions and challenge the team. You use AI tools in your own work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication with engineers, product, and business stakeholders, and fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI platform topics such as model access, governance, observability, rate limiting, or cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have driven adoption of new tools or practices across an engineering organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading distributed or hybrid teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated industry such as banking or fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box. If you have led a platform or developer-tooling team and you are excited about what AI changes for engineering, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure Germany is seeking a driven, results-oriented Commercial Account Executive to expand and grow our German commercial business. This high-impact sales role suits a self-directed operator who can create pipeline, open new accounts, expand existing relationships, and consistently move opportunities from discovery through to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll combine the speed and stamina of a strong hunter with the relationship-building and business sense of a trusted advisor. You’ll work closely with Sales Engineering, Channel, Partner Sales, Field Marketing, Customer Success, and other teams to deliver measurable value for customers and hit revenue targets across the German commercial market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Commercial Account Executive, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promote Innovative Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Advocate for our complete portfolio – storage, Kubernetes data services, and subscription offerings – as a strategic data platform for German commercial accounts.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong connections with customers and keep satisfaction high. Develop and execute a territory plan across whitespace and installed-base accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Strategise:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct pursuit teams and build account plans to win new customers. Find and create new business opportunities while expanding adoption within existing commercial accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage the Sales Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive activities to meet and exceed quota. Build and maintain a healthy, qualified pipeline through structured prospecting, partner engagement, customer meetings, marketing-led events, and targeted account activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Partners:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Channel, GSI, and Ecosystem Partners in Germany to position Everpure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute Account Strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and carry out strategies to close deals consistently. Understand customer priorities, business drivers, and financial considerations, and connect them to relevant Everpure outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Results:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceed quota, maintain a strong pipeline, and drive referenceable business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate Effectively:&lt;/strong&gt; Present proposals that highlight Everpure’s benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To excel in this role, you should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong drive for sales and relationship building. Sound financial acumen and the ability to discuss business impact, investment priorities, and deal structures that benefit both sides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in direct and indirect sales to commercial accounts in Germany, with the ability to manage a mix of new-logo and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with Channel, GSI, and Ecosystem Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospecting Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced skills in engaging new customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambition and Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A goal-oriented attitude and a desire to drive change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Success:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of exceeding quota and maintaining a robust pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of cloud computing, data management, and data centre architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent time management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of field sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Native or bilingual German and professional English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position and we&#39;re considering candidates in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Product Management&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Grafana Labs, you&#39;ll develop a vision and strategy for your product domain. You will own the experience for your product as well as its roadmap and competitive positioning, and you will collaborate with company leadership on setting your product&#39;s goals. You will be the primary advocate and expert in your area, with a strong ability to communicate needs, functionality, and details effectively both to external customers and internal stakeholders. The teams and people you will be interacting with will be 100% remote and globally distributed, so strong and proactive communication is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Managers are the bridge that connects R&amp;amp;D to GTM. You are a facilitator who ensures the free flow of information across these teams and are expected to be technically proficient when representing our products to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Product Manager for Enterprise Deployment Solutions, you&#39;ll own the Grafana Labs offerings that run outside our standard multi-tenant SaaS. That includes &lt;strong&gt;Grafana Federal Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;, for organizations that need FedRAMP-authorized observability: US federal agencies; state, local, and education (SLED) customers; and commercial companies that sell FedRAMP offerings of their own. It also includes &lt;strong&gt;Grafana Cloud Bring Your Own Cloud (BYOC)&lt;/strong&gt;, which delivers the full Grafana Cloud experience while the customer pays the infrastructure bill directly to their cloud provider, saving them significantly at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to make Grafana Labs the obvious choice for organizations that can&#39;t use standard SaaS because of compliance, data, or cost-at-scale constraints. Deployment choices change the product: features that are simple in standard SaaS can be hard, expensive, or impossible in a regulated or customer-owned environment. You’ll be responsible for adapting existing Grafana Cloud capabilities to these environments, deciding which features come in, which wait, and which stay out, and occasionally building something specific to BYOC or Federal Cloud. You&#39;ll also help shape which deployment models we offer next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Along the way, you’ll use AI tools daily to speed up research, analyze product signals, and develop positioning, applying strong judgment to the results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Product Manager for Enterprise Deployment Solutions, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the vision, strategy, and roadmap for the Grafana Bring Your Own Cloud and Grafana Federal Cloud products, using product data and market research to balance customer value against engineering cost and technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own positioning, messaging, and differentiation for these products, including how they compare to regular Grafana Cloud, and partner with Product Marketing on launches, competitive analysis, enablement, and demand programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and Technical Program Management on buildouts for these environments, balancing customer timelines with engineering capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers, prospects, and the field on strategic deals and brief partners, resellers, and analysts on our deployment options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Compliance, and Legal to work through product changes affecting our authorization or existing customer commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re excited about you because you have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience on a technical B2B product, &lt;em&gt;or&lt;/em&gt; a technical background (software engineering, solutions architecture, SRE, or technical program management) plus a demonstrated move into product ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a non-standard SaaS deployment model, such as self-managed, air-gapped, sovereign, BYOC, single-tenant, or FedRAMP/government cloud, and a firsthand understanding of how it changes the product, its operations, and its economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure, platform software, or developer tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear product and go-to-market judgment: you&#39;ve shaped what a product should be and how it&#39;s positioned and sold, not only when it ships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in working with US public sector customers and learning their needs and buying cycles. Deep compliance expertise isn&#39;t required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading across multiple teams without direct authority, with excellent written and verbal communication in a remote, globally distributed organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to or building for US federal, state, or local government customers, or other highly regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with government or sovereign cloud frameworks, such as FedRAMP, StateRAMP/GovRAMP, BSI C5, or SecNumCloud, or with offerings such as AWS GovCloud, Azure Government, AWS European Sovereign Cloud, or GCP Sovereign Cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with pricing and packaging across deployment models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability, monitoring, or other data-intensive infrastructure products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with resellers, systems integrators, or cloud marketplace partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with open source software or commercial open source companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In Germany, the base compensation range for this role is EUR 124,571 &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- EUR 149,485&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
