&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite our growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;float: left; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Job-alerts-1.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;89% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/07/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-1-2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for maternity, paternity, adoption &amp;amp; fertility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Loans, Bike to Work scheme, Rental Deposit Loan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contributions through Payroll Giving and donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, gym memberships, cinema discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer hybrid working with a minimum of 2 days in the office. For our roles, such as Field or Home-based positions, different working arrangements apply - full details will be shared during the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 222, 180);&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-8.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, Rightmove will never discriminate based on age, disability, sex, race, religion or belief, gender reassignment, marriage / civil partnership, pregnancy/maternity or sexual orientation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Rightmove, we believe that a diverse and inclusive workforce leads to better innovation, productivity, and overall success. We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all employees, regardless of their background or identity, to develop and promote a diverse culture that reflects the communities we serve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;By applying, you confirm that you are aged at least 18 or over and&amp;nbsp;that you’ve read and understood our &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.rightmove.co.uk/c/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how we handle and protect your personal information during the recruitment process.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nscale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nscale is the GPU cloud engineered for AI. We provide cost-effective, high-performance infrastructure for AI start-ups and large enterprise customers.&amp;nbsp; Nscale enables AI-focused companies to achieve superior results by reducing the complexity of AI development. Our GPU cloud bolsters technical capabilities and directly supports strategic business outcomes, including cost management, rapid innovation, and environmental responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on a culture of relentless innovation, ownership, and accountability, where every team member takes pride in their work and drives it with excellence and urgency. As an Nscaler, you’ll build trust through openness and transparency, where everyone is inspired to do their best work. If you join our team, you’ll be contributing to building the technology that powers the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Site Security Manager is responsible for the daily management of all physical security operations at the Glomfjord Data Centre. The role ensures that security services delivered by Securitas meet Nscale standards while maintaining a secure environment for staff, contractors, visitors and customers. The Site Security Manager oversees reception security, visitor management, access control, security patrols and operational readiness while acting as the primary point of contact for day-to-day site security matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Site Security Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all physical security operations at Glomfjord.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security standards are consistently maintained.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct routine inspections of security controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with site procedures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Management &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the Securitas security contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise daily performance of security officers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct performance reviews and service meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure contractual service levels are achieved.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reception Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure reception operates professionally and securely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee visitor registration and identity verification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure visitor escorts are available where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visitor records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visitor Management&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all daytime visitor activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure customer visits are coordinated securely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure contractor access follows approved procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support VIP visits and government delegations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Security&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure CCTV, access control and intrusion detection systems remain operational.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct physical security inspections.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report defects and coordinate remedial actions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify perimeter security standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate responses to on-site security incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with emergency services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct investigations into physical security events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce incident reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ISO 27001 and SOC 2 audits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain site security documentation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer security audits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with customer physical security standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal&amp;nbsp; VP Global Physical and Data Centre Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Centre Operations&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilities&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Information Security&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Securitas&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customers&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emergency Services&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security vendors&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contractors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing contract security teams.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within data centres or critical infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of physical security systems.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing visitors and customer security requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supervising reception operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Genetec experience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security auditing experience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 27001 or SOC 2 knowledge.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting government or hyperscale customer environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer service&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contractor management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Can Offer You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the opportunity to help shape the operating standards behind a next-generation AI cloud platform, working on complex infrastructure challenges with real ownership and impact. This is a chance to play a meaningful role in scaling high-performance, sustainable data centre operations in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there’s anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The responsibilities outlined in this job description are not exhaustive and are intended to provide a general overview of the position. The employee may be required to perform additional duties, tasks, and responsibilities as assigned by management, consistent with the skills and qualifications required for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3015 - Director, Media Solutions - Scrum Master, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with teams across the United States, Europe, and Asia to deliver high-impact solutions in a collaborative, multicultural environment.&amp;nbsp;We are seeking an experienced and passionate Scrum Master to guide and coach our development teams within Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions. You will be a champion of Agile values and principles, fostering a culture of continuous improvement, transparency, and self-organization. Your role will be critical in enabling our teams to deliver high-quality data products and AI platforms efficiently and effectively, contributing directly to WPP&#39;s innovation in the AdTech space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leader who empowers teams, removing impediments and fostering an environment of collaboration and psychological safety.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert facilitator, skilled at guiding teams through Agile ceremonies and discussions to achieve clear outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong communicator and coach, adept at nurturing Agile mindsets and practices across individuals and the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and adaptable, able to anticipate challenges, resolve conflicts, and guide teams through change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about continuous improvement, always seeking ways to optimize team performance and delivery predictability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you will do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate Agile Processes and Ceremonies&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate all Scrum ceremonies (e.g., Daily Scrum, Sprint Planning, Sprint Review, Sprint Retrospective) ensuring they are productive, engaging, and aligned with Agile principles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the Product Owner manage the product backlog, ensuring stories are well-defined, estimated, and prioritized.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team in self-organizing and cross-functional collaboration, helping them to achieve sprint goals and ultimately, product vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure transparent communication of team progress, impediments, and metrics to all relevant stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach and Develop Agile Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the development team on Scrum principles, Agile values, and engineering best practices to maximize productivity and continuous improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and support to the Product Owner in understanding and implementing Agile practices, particularly regarding backlog management and stakeholder collaboration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of open communication, inspect-and-adapt, and continuous learning within the team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help resolve team conflicts and build a strong sense of team ownership and accountability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remove Impediments and Protect the Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, track, and actively work to remove impediments that hinder the team&#39;s progress and productivity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shield the team from external distractions and interferences, allowing them to focus on sprint commitments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other Scrum Masters and management to identify and address organizational impediments to Agile adoption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote effective decision-making processes within the team, encouraging autonomy while ensuring alignment with broader goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Continuous Improvement and Metrics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the team in using metrics (e.g., velocity, burn-down/up charts) to understand and improve their performance and predictability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead retrospective meetings, facilitating discussions around &quot;what went well,&quot; &quot;what could be improved,&quot; and action items for the next sprint.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Agile adoption and maturity across the organization, sharing best practices and insights with other teams and leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the team establish and refine their definition of &quot;Done&quot; to ensure consistent quality and delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this opportunity looks right for you, we are looking for candidates who have: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a dedicated Scrum Master for multiple software development teams, preferably in a data-intensive or technical product environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding and practical application of Scrum framework, Agile principles, and various Agile methodologies (Kanban, Lean).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to facilitate meetings effectively, manage conflict, and drive consensus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English fluency C1/C2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, coaching, and mentoring skills, with the ability to influence and inspire others.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Agile project management tools (e.g., Jira, Azure DevOps, Asana).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the software development lifecycle and common engineering practices (e.g., CI/CD, TDD).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex technical issues at a high level and articulate them to non-technical stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem-solver with a strong sense of ownership and accountability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), Professional Scrum Master (PSM I/II), or other equivalent Agile certifications are highly desirable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3014 - Director, Media Solutions - Engineering, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership for the Media Solutions engineering team; sets standards, designs patterns, and delivery practices; ensures solutions are supportable, observable, and secure; mentors engineers; owns technical risk and quality gates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligns solution design with agreed architecture patterns set by the global team. Aligns work to the strategic initiatives and roadmap set by the platforms operations lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the software engineering team best practices, leadership and people management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and evolve modern digital products using C#, TypeScript, and React (as applied to Next.js and Remix).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop APIs and backend services using .NET Core and relational databases, supporting composable and data-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cloud infrastructure in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AWS or Azure&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;using &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with &lt;strong&gt;Azure DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to automate build and deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, UX, Strategy, and DevOps specialists to co-create high-quality, outcome-focused solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate with headless SaaS tools like Contentful, DatoCMS, Prismic, Algolia, and others in the composable ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply DevOps and performance engineering practices — including caching, observability, and scalability — to deliver resilient products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our Software Engineering discipline, sharing knowledge and helping shape how we build and deliver technology at Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll likely have experience developing web applications in a modern technology stack and a strong foundation in both back-end and front-end development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love you to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with C# / .NET Core, TypeScript, and React (Next.js / Remix).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good grasp of relational database design and API development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience deploying to Azure using Infrastructure as Code (Terraform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with headless CMS and composable architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building products that are accessible, performant, secure, and user-centred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset — you value working as part of a multi-disciplinary team and learning from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
