&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7576&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3fd7f2e43b66&quot;&gt;On a weekly basis provide &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;LM&lt;/span&gt; managers a monthly &amp;amp; quarterly forecast&lt;/p&gt;
