&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives prides itself on cultivating a supportive, connected remote team doing work that matters. We do everything possible to ensure our employees are connected and set up for success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The salary range&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for applicants based in the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;$120,000 to $135,000&lt;/span&gt; annually. The exact offer will be determined by various factors, such as the candidate’s skills and experience relative to the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For applicants based outside the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, salaries are set according to national labor rates for the international NGO sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Resolve to Save Lives provides a generous package of benefits, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Health insurance for you and your dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contributions toward retirement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Paid annual leave and sick leave, in addition to public holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Two paid, week-long organization-wide breaks at mid-year and end-of-year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Professional development and home office setup benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Up-to-date computer equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;RTSL believes its programs are strengthened when they are developed and supported by individuals with diverse life experiences whose understanding of social and cultural issues can help make our work and workforce more inclusive. We encourage applications from and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, ancestry, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, marital status, organ donor status, or status as a veteran. Resolve to Save Lives &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;complies with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; all applicable US EEO laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Datadog Security design team (K9 Design, as we lovingly call it) is hiring a senior product design manager to lead design across our security products. This is a chance to shape an industry-leading experience for a new kind of Datadog user: security practitioners who need to catch threats where they start, stop them when they land, and shut down exposures before they turn into something worse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead a team of designers at various stages of their careers across cloud, code and data security, turning an overwhelming amount of signal into something a security team can act on. The goal: build the security product people want to spend their day in. You&#39;ll own the design, push for excellence, and partner closely with Product and Engineering leadership to get there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design direction across your team&#39;s products, and hold the bar for design excellence end to end: interactions, visual detail, consistency and cohesion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re in the work. Run critiques, give direct and useful feedback, and push the team toward bolder, more opinionated solutions rather than safe ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and grow designers across our Paris, Madrid and New York offices, helping each of them do the best work of their careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define a security design system built on top of Datadog&#39;s existing components, with the security practitioner&#39;s workflows in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering leaders to evolve cross-platform thinking, shape roadmaps, and to set how the three disciplines work together day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take accountability for the product and business outcomes your team&#39;s design work influences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring AI fluency to how your team works, from how design gets explored and validated to how it gets shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in design, including experience leading and growing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A design leader first: a user advocate with a sharp eye for detail, strong taste and the willingness to get into the work and give direct feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leveling up a team&#39;s output, with before-and-after examples of how your leadership transformed the design of a product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve led complex products or features: a zero-to-one launch, a reimagining of something established, or both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong communicator who collaborates effectively with executive and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to demonstrate AI fluency, either in your own work or in how you&#39;ve led teams through it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating the technical complexity of modern software development and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally&lt;/strong&gt;: security domain experience, or a portfolio of information-dense, data-rich interfaces. Industry-leading work on complex B2B, B2C or consumer products counts for just as much here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits and Growth&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product training to develop an in-depth understanding of our product and space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous career development and pathing opportunities for internal mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title: Customer Enablement Specialist (12 Month Fixed-Term)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Paris&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: €42,400 - €53,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: Client Delivery EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To: Operating Model Design Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is based in Paris, France and requires an existing right to work in the EU.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your application in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be a key driver of our mission to reimagine energy and make net-zero a reality for everyone. As a &lt;strong&gt;Customer Enablement Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the bridge between our innovative technology and the people who use it. You will empower our clients, partners, and colleagues in French-speaking markets to not only understand our platform but to master it - including the AI-powered capabilities we are continuously building and rolling out. Your work will directly accelerate Kaluza&#39;s growth by ensuring our users are confident, capable, and ready to support the energy transition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Training &amp;amp; Programme Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted advisor to our clients, partners, and internal teams, performing deep learning needs analysis to understand their unique operational challenges. You&#39;ll manage your workstream with genuine project and programme management discipline - planning, sequencing and tracking delivery within complex, multi-stakeholder client programmes, ideally drawing on agile ways of working to stay responsive as scope evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Creation &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; You will be the master of making the complex simple. You&#39;ll create high-quality, engaging training materials in both &lt;strong&gt;French&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, including interactive workshops, e-learning modules, and quick reference guides - translating not just today&#39;s platform, but AI features and products still in development, into training that&#39;s ready the moment they go live. You&#39;ll deliver these sessions virtually and in-person, inspiring your audience and building their confidence with every interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Adoption &amp;amp; Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Your role is to accelerate the adoption of the Kaluza platform. You will provide post-training support and coaching, monitor the effectiveness of your programmes, and continuously iterate based on feedback and performance metrics. You&#39;ll ensure our training leads to real-world, positive change for our users and the energy industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual Fluency, to a high standard:&lt;/strong&gt; You are fluent in both &lt;strong&gt;French&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, with outstanding written and spoken communication skills - essential for day-to-day stakeholder management across multiple countries, up to and including executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Technical SaaS Training Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record designing and delivering training in a SaaS or technology environment, ideally with hands-on experience of operational or technical instructional training rather than generalist L&amp;amp;D delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Programme Management Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong project and/or programme management experience gained within complex, multi-stakeholder environments; experience of agile delivery is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable experience gained within an operational environment - energy sector operations and/or contact centre settings are especially valued - giving you a first-hand understanding of the pressures and workflows your training needs to support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable experience building, productionalising, or delivering training on AI features and products while they are still in development, and genuine confidence working with AI tools as part of your own everyday practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplification Master:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a natural ability to take complex technical and business concepts and translate them into clear, engaging, and practical learning materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engaging Facilitator:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a confident and dynamic presenter, able to captivate diverse audiences and create a fun, interactive learning environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Proactive:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a team player who builds strong relationships and is proactive in identifying opportunities to support others and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energy Sector Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; A practical background in energy utility operations or decarbonisation technologies, beyond the operational experience above, that lets you connect training directly to the real-world challenges our clients face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Training Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A demonstrated track record of scaling training programmes and an ability to think strategically about how to build and expand a learning culture across an international organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in &lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est une nouvelle génération de cabinet de conseil spécialisée en Data dont plus de 2500 collaborateurs répartis sur 27 pays ont pour mission d’accompagner la transformation chez nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous offrons une large gamme de solutions data-driven, que nous adaptions aux besoins spécifiques de nos clients, que ce soit des projets IA pour l&#39;automatisation des process internes à chaque étape de leur chaîne de valeur, la création d&#39;expériences consommateurs innovantes et personnalisées, le conseil en stratégie data et marketing digital jusqu&#39;à la gestion du mix-média et plus encore !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La performance de nos services data repose sur une réelle expertise technologique en Intelligence Artificielle et des compétences métiers acquises auprès de plus de 1000 clients dans le monde, tels que Orange, Carrefour, Engie, Emirates, Deutsche Telekom, Monoprix…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La force d&#39;Artefact repose sur un mix unique d&#39;atouts: une connaissance des technologies de pointe en data, des méthodes agiles permettant de délivrer très rapidement les projets et des équipes composées des meilleurs experts dans leurs domaines (business consultants, data analysts, data scientists, ingénieurs data…).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce contexte, nous sommes à la recherche d’un(e) stagiaire Assistant Comptable pour rejoindre notre équipe finance en&lt;strong&gt; janvier 2027&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sous la responsabilité du Responsable Comptable France, vous assurez la gestion de l’état administratif financier de l’entreprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De ce fait, vous contribuerez avec l’équipe finance France à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factures fournisseurs :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collecter les factures et informations manquantes auprès des fournisseurs et équipes métiers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contrôler les factures dès leur réception,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valider ces dernières auprès des différentes équipes,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Saisir les factures fournisseurs dans le logiciel Sage,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre à jour et contrôler les codes analytiques des écritures comptables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les comptes fournisseurs (lettrages, justifications des soldes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note de Frais :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contrôler et valider les notes de frais,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Les intégrer dans Sage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Divers :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l’amélioration des outils de gestion (Yooz, Sage 1000, Reporting BI…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser diverses tâches administratives,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à la préparation de la clôture semestrielle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La variété des diverses tâches qui vous seront attribuées vous permettra d&#39;enrichir vos connaissances et de contribuer à l’amélioration de notre service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous préparez un diplôme dans le domaine de la gestion, comptabilité, contrôle, audit, finance et&amp;nbsp; vous justifiez idéalement d’une première expérience professionnelle (en stage par exemple) sur un poste similaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez les techniques comptables et les logiciels informatiques du métier (Idéalement Sage, le pack office).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisé, enthousiaste, vous êtes reconnu(e) pour votre énergie, votre autonomie et votre sens de responsabilité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez l’esprit d’équipe et vous êtes à l’aise en communication, tant orale qu’écrite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salaire : &lt;/strong&gt;1200€ brut / mois&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de Recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien RH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec le Responsable comptable France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien DAF France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

